WEBVTT

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.860
It should be
somewhere around here...

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.450
Ooh, I can see it!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.870
There it is!

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.080
Sea Kinsetsu!

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.630
Once used to extract resources from the ocean floor,
it has since been abandoned!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:26.090
Because it had become home to sea Pokémon,
it was left as a nature preserve!

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:28.720
It’s really huge!

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:34.390
There’s Ms. Asahi!

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:39.270
In order to attempt
a new Project Mew Trial Mission,

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:44.520
Go and Satoshi have arrived at Sea Kinsetsu,
an ocean facility in the Hoenn region.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.490
Good work, Whaleko.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:50.410
See ya again when we’re done!

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.410
Now, let’s get going.

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.580
This is the entrance.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.250
All right! Let’s go!

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:02.170
Stop!

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:07.210
Sorry, but this mission is
only for the challenger himself.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.880
So this is as far as you go.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.050
Wha...?! No way!

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:12.760
Don’t worry, Satoshi.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:15.010
I’ll clear it for sure.

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.310
Okay.

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.060
Give it your best shot, Go!

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:22.480
Go, show me the Pokémon
you brought with you.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.610
Sure. Here he is!

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.200
Inteleon, huh?

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:37.740
Then if you head down to the lowest deck
from here, you’ll be at the meet-up spot.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.160
The other challengers
are down there, too.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.290
Right!

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:43.540
Um, is Shigeru already...?

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.290
I think he was...

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:47.840
...competing at a different site.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.300
He shouldn’t be coming here.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:51.800
Huh?! I-Is that so...?

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:54.180
I wanted to face him today...

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:58.010
You make it sound like
the other Challengers are nothing to you.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.350
Oh, that’s not...

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:01.520
The mission won’t be that easy.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:05.940
You’ll have plenty of strong rivals,
so watch your back.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.020
Go!

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:08.570
Y-Yeah!

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:10.610
Let’s go, Inteleon!

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.720
This would be
the lowest deck, right?

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.020
But nobody’s here...

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:06.180
Where’s this meetup spot?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.020
It looks like all of you
have reached the lowest deck.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:15.990
Your mission this time is survival.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.530
Have Pokémon battles with the other Challengers,
and come out on top.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.740
Survival...

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:25.040
The last person remaining
will receive three tokens.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.250
Well then,
let the mission start!

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.830
Hey, wai—

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.960
This is... a floor map?

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:35.300
That means...
the red lights are Challengers,

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:37.670
and the blue one
is me, then?

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:39.590
There!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.760
Granbull, use Ice Fang!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.020
Inteleon, use Mud Shot!

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:52.650
Granbull!

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:56.860
Inteleon!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:57.610
Go!

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:02.160
Tokio?

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:03.660
You’re here, too?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.660
I’m glad I found you, Go!

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.370
The battling started so abruptly...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.500
It disappeared.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.500
Does this mean we won’t see
the map for ten minutes?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.050
Rock Slide!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.050
Gamenodes,
use Stone Edge!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.970
Dodge and use Mud Shot!

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.140
Here’s our chance!
Zangoose!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.150
Consecutive Cut!

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:37.480
Sirknight! Moonforce!

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.040
Inteleon, use Snipe Shot!

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:59.920
Granbull, Zangoose, Gamenodes:
unable to battle.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.840
Eliminated challengers,
please return to the entrance.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.260
Over already, eh?

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.850
That sure was fast...

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.390
What a relief!
We won!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:13.600
Battling together worked great.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.100
Hold on...

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.150
Hey, why don’t we
keep battling together?!

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.280
I had the same idea!

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:26.740
All right!
Go and Tokio formed a team!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:31.370
Realizing they can battle as a team
means they’ve cleared the first hurdle.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.330
Think they’re gonna
clear the mission?

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.630
Well, I can’t know for sure.

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:38.750
Kuwagannon!
Use Scissor Cross!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.130
Discharge!

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:44.930
Dodge it!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.390
He’s strong...

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.100
We’re finished...

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.770
Don’t take it personally.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.230
Why, you’re pretty good.

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.860
Hey, you.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.690
Name’s Layla.
Wanna team up?

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.610
I’m Shun'ya.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.870
What will I gain
from teaming up with you?

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.450
How about a trial run,
just to see?

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.500
It’s dark in here...

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.130
Inteleon,
can you check out our surroundings?

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:31.260
Wow!
He’s like a spy!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:35.270
Sirknight, you can let us know of any dangers
with your predictive powers.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:39.310
Getting attacked
by someone in hiding would be bad.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.690
We need to make the first move!

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:43.610
Um...

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:45.780
Why don’t we just
hide somewhere?

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.570
If we survive until the end,
we’ll clear the mission, right?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.660
We wouldn’t have to battle anyone...

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.540
Of course...

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.130
Even if we hid,
this would give away our location.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:00.420
Yeah.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:05.210
This means we actually have to come up
with a strategy, and defeat our rivals.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.840
Still...

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.800
Don’t you think there are
too many paired-up challengers?

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.930
They...
don’t seem to be battling.

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.140
They even move together.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:20.020
That means... The surviving challengers
are the ones that realized teams have the advantage.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.070
Hey! Hello!

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.870
2v2, huh?
Looks fun, no?

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.620
Dirtengu and Jupetta...

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.080
Well, well...
I’ll take care of the Inteleon!

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.370
I’m gonna beat
the Sirknight, no?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.370
Razor Leaf!

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:45.920
Shoot them down
with Mud Shot!

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:51.050
Jupetta! Ghost Dive!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.260
Reflector!

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:55.810
Shadow Strike!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.940
We’re at a type disadvantage!

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:04.190
Inteleon! One more—

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.480
Go! Don’t try to do it alone!

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.780
Right...
Just like that time...

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.660
Leaf Blade!

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:16.450
Reflector!

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.330
Leave defense to me!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.500
Got it!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.420
Mud Shot!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.380
<i>I’m</i> the one you’re fighting, no?!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.590
Shadow Ball!

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:37.770
Inteleon!
Shoot it down with Mud Shot!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.440
What?!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:43.940
All right!

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:45.650
I’m not finished here!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:47.110
Razor Leaf!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.780
Sirknight! Use Heal Pulse!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.920
He recovered?!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.840
Aqua Break!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:20.980
Jupetta, Dirtengu:
unable to battle.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:24.400
Eliminated challengers,
please return to the entrance.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.560
Gah... This stinks...

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.940
It’s over, no?

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:29.690
We did it!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.030
Yeah!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.570
Warrgle, Sawamurar:
unable to battle.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.620
Aw, these guys are
complete pushovers.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:41.410
I was expecting a tougher mission.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.580
Are you sure about that?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.750
Anyone could be an easy mark
if they let their guard down.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:52.090
Go and Tokio
are doing a good job keeping ahead!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.050
Maybe it’s about time.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:55.630
Huh?

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:23.000
Huh?
These are the only challengers left?

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.920
This might be over
sooner than we thought.

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:50.060
Watakko?!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.020
Why?!

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:57.490
Huh?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:02.450
Go! Don’t fall asleep!
This is Sleep Powder!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.830
Is this also part of the mission?!

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:06.710
Let’s run for it!

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.080
Yeah!

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.090
Now there’s Dogas?!

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:17.300
This way!

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:21.260
What’s happening?!

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:28.520
What is this?!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:30.190
Go!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.570
Hey—
Did... you do that?

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:38.570
If they hope to be Chasers,
they need the skills to deal with a surprise like this.

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.990
Who knows what will happen
during the actual search?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:47.370
If someone panics and falls apart,
they’ll hold the others back.

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:51.290
They need to make the right calls
at times like these.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.630
Looks like they’re gone.

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:58.090
Hiding was the right idea!

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.630
I’m amazed you noticed
there was a room here.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:04.600
When I saw the map,
I quickly committed it to memory.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:08.560
I also remembered
where the other challengers were, but...

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:11.230
They must’ve moved a lot
in that commotion.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:14.770
Do we really have no choice
but to battle?

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.740
I don’t really like it.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.490
I’d rather make friends
than have to battle.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:23.320
But you can’t clear the mission
by doing that.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:28.080
But we’re all allies,
looking for Mew, right?!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.330
Can’t we all work together?

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.830
Well...

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.330
Eek! Help!

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:35.540
Let’s go see!

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.340
Yeah.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.430
What?

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:44.970
Oh! Help me!

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.350
What happened?

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:50.640
He promised we’d team up,
and then he suddenly attacked me!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:51.770
What?!

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:55.560
I simply took the chance.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.650
Her fault for letting her guard down
in a mission.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:03.410
Leopardas is already unable to battle!
It’s cruel to keep attacking it like that!

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.740
Hey, please,
can you help me out here?

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.160
S-Sure.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.370
Wait, Tokio.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.710
We can’t trust her...

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:14.000
Where’s the Drone Rotom
to give the verdict?

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.340
You’re so cruel!
You think I’m a liar?!

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:20.130
Yeah, Go.
We have to trust her.

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.300
Tokio!

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:24.930
If you want someone to fight,
we’ll take you on!

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.850
Leopardas.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.640
Surprise Attack.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.560
Now, Kuwagannon!
Discharge!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.070
Sirknight!

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.860
Is that paralysis?

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.990
I’m amazed that your plan worked.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.120
I thought maybe he was catching on...

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.500
Good thing his partner’s so gullible!

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.550
Let’s go, Shun'ya.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:02.760
It’s 2v1 now.
We just need to beat that Inteleon.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:07.680
We used the commotion earlier
to take out all the other challengers.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.510
You’re the only ones left!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.060
Inteleon, hide in the water!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:16.770
Snipe Shot!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:18.520
Dodge it!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:21.190
Sirknight...

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.070
I’m sorry, Go...
This is my fault...

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.570
Don’t worry!
Leave it to me!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.830
One more Snipe Shot!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.040
We’ll smoke you out!

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.080
Kuwagannon! Discharge!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:41.920
Another Discharge!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.170
Leopardas! Crossroad Kill!

00:15:50.890 --> 00:15:52.640
Inteleon! Camouflage yourself!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.390
No, you don’t!

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.730
String Shot!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.520
I’ve got you!

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:05.320
Sirknight!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.370
Evil Pulse!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.080
Inteleon!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.370
It’s over!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.420
We’ll be taking the tokens.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.590
Sirknight! Eerie Light!

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.760
You’re kidding!
You shouldn’t be able to...

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:33.100
Go! It’s now or never!

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:33.970
Yeah!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.850
Shake free, Inteleon!

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:41.480
Snipe Shot!

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:46.740
Leopardas!

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:48.360
That Sirknight from before...

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.570
Scissor Cross!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.450
Aqua Break!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.750
Leopardas, Kuwagannon:
unable to battle.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.470
We’ll get our payback
in the next mission.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:20.940
It’s just...
me and Tokio.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.560
We survived...

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:26.650
We did it!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:27.440
Yeah!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.570
Good job, Go!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.320
Don’t go and celebrate just yet.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.540
Only one person may clear the mission.

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:40.040
You two need to decide the winner.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:40.790
Huh?!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.290
But that’s...

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:45.250
I guess there’s no choice.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.920
But I’m glad
you’re the one remaining, Go.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.720
Ms. Asahi, I’m withdrawing.

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:51.590
Tokio?!

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.930
Withdrawing?!
Are you serious?

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.180
Yes.

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:58.600
I won’t fight Go.
I won’t fight a friend.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:17:59.930
I can wait for another chance—

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.310
You can’t!

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.060
Go?

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:05.020
You don’t know
if there’ll be another chance!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.940
Chasing after Mew to reach Celebi...

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.690
Wasn’t that your precious dream?

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.160
It’s a chance at catching Mew...

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.240
A chance at
making your dream come true...

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:17.660
You can’t just abandon that!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.040
I want to support you, Tokio!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:23.330
But I can’t give up, either!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.460
So let’s have a battle!

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:26.540
Go...

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.550
We’ll both go all out!
No holding back!

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.890
Got it.
Let’s do it.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:38.720
Go...

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:45.770
Sirknight and Inteleon
are both at their limits.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.520
One hit will decide the battle.

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:51.650
Camouflage yourself, Inteleon!

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:54.200
Sirknight! Predict danger!

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:04.410
Mud Shot!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:08.090
Dodge it and use Moonforce!

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:17.970
Snipe Shot!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.930
Eerie Light!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.770
Moonforce!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.780
Inteleon!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.950
Inteleon: unable to battle.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.080
Tokio has cleared the mission.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.540
Everyone,
please return to the entrance.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:51.550
This can’t be...

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.090
You did great, Inteleon.

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:00.050
Take a nice long rest.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.140
You did it, Tokio!

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:05.810
Congrats!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.020
Thank you!

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:10.310
I owe it to you,
for showing me I was being naïve.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.400
I see.

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.150
Well, shall we head back, then?

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.400
I-I...

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.570
Go on ahead of me.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:21.990
Sure.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.590
Tokio, congratulations on
clearing the mission.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.300
I’m sending you three tokens.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:47.060
Thank you very much!

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:50.650
Also, I will grant the 2nd place
challenger two tokens,

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:54.690
and the 3rd and 4th place
challengers one token.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.940
All right!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:00.200
Tsurugi, is your event over?

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.070
Yes.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.530
Who cleared it?

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.530
Shigeru.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:06.080
I see. I thought so.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.370
Rainy season is ending
sooner than we thought.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:13.040
We don’t have time to waste
selecting Chasers.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.460
As such, anyone with
less than four tokens as of now...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.090
...can be disqualified.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:21.550
Good point.
Which means...

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.140
These are the remaining Challengers.

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:29.230
I’m still only in 7th place...?

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:34.650
The Chaser selection
is finally reaching its climax.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:40.320
Will Go be able to reach the passing line
of being in the top three?

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:09.530
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:10.870
Go!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:15.460
Let’s follow Pikachu!

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:19.210
He might’ve found
that mysterious Pokémon!

00:23:20.090 --> 00:23:22.460
Running in the snow
is so hard!

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:24.090
Huh?

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:25.340
What’s wrong?

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.720
I can hear...
something...

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:29.430
A piano?

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:31.350
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:34.390
Mohn and Lilie,
A Reunion in the Snow!!
